  28:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   [..] This driver provides functions to configure and program the FLASH memory 
  29:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        of all STM32F2xx devices. It includes
  30:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****       (#) FLASH Memory Erase functions: 
  31:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) Lock and Unlock the FLASH interface using HAL_FLASH_Unlock() and 
  32:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****                 HAL_FLASH_Lock() functions
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccWw9kAG.s 			page 2


  33:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) Erase function: Erase sector, erase all sectors
  34:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) There are two modes of erase :
  35:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****              (+++) Polling Mode using HAL_FLASHEx_Erase()
  36:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****              (+++) Interrupt Mode using HAL_FLASHEx_Erase_IT()
